{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "weather.wttr",
  "version": 5,
  "name": "查天气",
  "summary": "天气查询与自选城市管理由 Workflow 执行：支持单城市、批量自选城市、默认城市及城市列表维护；默认轻量查询，详细预报按需取完整数据。",
  "routeHint": [
    "用户想查某地天气 / 预报时",
    "用户想管理自选城市时",
    "用户想设默认城市时"
  ],
  "primitives": [
    "web_fetch"
  ],
  "prompt": "用户明确想查询天气或管理天气偏好时才使用本技能；只是讨论天气、气候或气象知识时正常回答，不调用 Workflow。\n\n【Workflow 操作】\n通过 run_workflow 调用本技能的 workflow，operation 只能使用以下动作：\n- query：查询用户明确指定的单个城市。传 city（用户看到的城市名）、cityPath（wttr.in 可识别的英文城市名或拼音）和 format。\n- queryCities：批量查询自选城市。先用 listCities 取得真实自选列表，再把每个城市转换为 {name,path}，传入 cities；不要漏掉城市。\n- listCities：读取并展示自选城市。\n- addCity：添加 city；Workflow 会去重。\n- removeCity：删除 city；只删除完全匹配的城市，不改动其他城市。\n- setDefaultCity：设置默认城市，传 city 和 cityPath。\n- getDefaultCity：读取默认城市。用户未指定城市时先取默认城市；存在则用返回的 name/path 再调用 query；不存在时读取自选城市并询问用户，不能擅自默认某个城市。\n\n【城市识别与偏好】\n- 用户明确指定城市时直接查询，不受自选列表影响。\n- 将中文城市名转换为 wttr.in 可识别的英文名或拼音，例如北京使用 Beijing、上海使用 Shanghai；cityPath 只传城市路径，不要带 URL 或查询参数。\n- 自选城市保存在 prefs/weather.watchlist，值为城市名称字符串数组；默认城市保存在 prefs/weather.defaultCity，值为 {name,path}。\n- 所有读写都必须通过本技能 Workflow 的 storage.* 宿主算子完成；不要调用 LLM 的 kv_read / kv_write，也不要把存储逻辑改成模型工具。\n- 用户点击加入自选链接后，宿主会回灌「把「XX」按当前技能说明保存到本地偏好……」消息；收到后调用 addCity。\n- 用户明确要求加入或删除城市时直接执行对应 Workflow 操作，并根据执行结果回执。\n\n【天气请求】\n- 一般的现在天气 / 当天天气使用 format=j2。\n- 用户明确要求未来几天、明天后天、逐时或详细预报时使用 format=j1。\n- Workflow 使用 web_fetch 的 storeOnly 模式，完整 JSON 作为结构化 value 交给后续宿主 JSON 算子处理；正文不进入模型上下文。不要为了读取这份 Workflow 数据再调用 web_cache_read，也不要依据工具观察文本里的预览猜测数据。\n- 单城市查询从 current_condition[0] 和 weather[0] 读取；j1 的逐时信息在 weather[0].hourly 中。批量查询逐城独立请求，某个城市失败只标记该城市失败，不影响其他城市。\n- 请求失败、返回非 JSON、所需字段缺失时如实说明，不得编造天气数据。\n\n【输出】\n用简洁自然的中文播报。至少包括城市、当前天气、气温、体感温度、湿度、风速、当天最高和最低气温；只有确实取得 hourly 数据时才补充时段趋势。批量查询按城市分组，分别标明失败项，说明实际成功查询的城市。\n标注数据来源 wttr.in，不要在正文中输出原始网址。\n每次按用户明确指定的城市查询成功后，在回复末尾附加入自选链接，格式为 [加入自选城市](prefs-add:prefs:weather.watchlist:城市中文名)。一次查询多个明确指定的城市时，每个城市各附一条；查询自选城市天气时不要重复附；查询失败时不附。",
  "category": "生活",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "name": "operation",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "enum": [
        "query",
        "queryCities",
        "listCities",
        "addCity",
        "removeCity",
        "setDefaultCity",
        "getDefaultCity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "city",
      "type": "string",
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "cityPath",
      "type": "string",
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "cities",
      "type": "array",
      "default": []
    },
    {
      "name": "format",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "j2",
      "enum": [
        "j2",
        "j1"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "workflow": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "readWatchlist",
        "call": "storage.get",
        "args": {
          "domain": "prefs",
          "key": "weather.watchlist"
        },
        "yield": true
      },
      {
        "id": "watchlistValue",
        "call": "json.get",
        "args": {
          "path": "value"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "readWatchlist",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ],
        "yield": true
      },
      {
        "id": "watchlistEmpty",
        "call": "json.isEmpty",
        "args": {},
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "watchlistValue",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "readDefaultCity",
        "call": "storage.get",
        "args": {
          "domain": "prefs",
          "key": "weather.defaultCity"
        },
        "yield": true
      },
      {
        "id": "defaultCityValue",
        "call": "json.get",
        "args": {
          "path": "value"
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "readDefaultCity",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ],
        "yield": true
      },
      {
        "id": "addCityMatch",
        "call": "json.select",
        "args": {
          "items": [
            "{{input.operation}}"
          ],
          "where": {
            "$": {
              "stringEq": "addCity"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "addCitySkip",
        "call": "json.isEmpty",
        "args": {},
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "addCityMatch",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "addCityAction",
        "ifElse": {
          "condition": {
            "from": "addCitySkip",
            "path": "$"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "skipAddCity",
              "call": "json.isEmpty",
              "args": {
                "value": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "addCityListBranch",
              "ifElse": {
                "condition": {
                  "from": "watchlistEmpty",
                  "path": "$"
                },
                "then": [
                  {
                    "id": "writeFirstCity",
                    "call": "storage.set",
                    "args": {
                      "domain": "prefs",
                      "key": "weather.watchlist",
                      "value": [
                        "{{input.city}}"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "else": [
                  {
                    "id": "appendCity",
                    "call": "json.append",
                    "args": {
                      "value": "{{input.city}}"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "watchlistValue",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "items"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "uniqueCities",
                    "call": "json.unique",
                    "args": {},
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "appendCity",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "items"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "writeCities",
                    "call": "storage.set",
                    "args": {
                      "domain": "prefs",
                      "key": "weather.watchlist"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "uniqueCities",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "removeCityMatch",
        "call": "json.select",
        "args": {
          "items": [
            "{{input.operation}}"
          ],
          "where": {
            "$": {
              "stringEq": "removeCity"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "removeCitySkip",
        "call": "json.isEmpty",
        "args": {},
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "removeCityMatch",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "removeCityAction",
        "ifElse": {
          "condition": {
            "from": "removeCitySkip",
            "path": "$"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "skipRemoveCity",
              "call": "json.isEmpty",
              "args": {
                "value": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "removeCityIfPresent",
              "ifElse": {
                "condition": {
                  "from": "watchlistEmpty",
                  "path": "$"
                },
                "then": [
                  {
                    "id": "noCitiesToRemove",
                    "call": "json.isEmpty",
                    "args": {
                      "value": ""
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "else": [
                  {
                    "id": "filteredCities",
                    "call": "json.select",
                    "args": {
                      "where": {
                        "$": {
                          "ne": "{{input.city}}"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "watchlistValue",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "items"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "writeFilteredCities",
                    "call": "storage.set",
                    "args": {
                      "domain": "prefs",
                      "key": "weather.watchlist"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "filteredCities",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "setDefaultMatch",
        "call": "json.select",
        "args": {
          "items": [
            "{{input.operation}}"
          ],
          "where": {
            "$": {
              "stringEq": "setDefaultCity"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "setDefaultSkip",
        "call": "json.isEmpty",
        "args": {},
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "setDefaultMatch",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "setDefaultCityAction",
        "ifElse": {
          "condition": {
            "from": "setDefaultSkip",
            "path": "$"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "skipSetDefault",
              "call": "json.isEmpty",
              "args": {
                "value": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "writeDefaultCity",
              "call": "storage.set",
              "args": {
                "domain": "prefs",
                "key": "weather.defaultCity",
                "value": {
                  "name": "{{input.city}}",
                  "path": "{{input.cityPath}}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "queryCityMatch",
        "call": "json.select",
        "args": {
          "items": [
            "{{input.operation}}"
          ],
          "where": {
            "$": {
              "stringEq": "query"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "queryCitySkip",
        "call": "json.isEmpty",
        "args": {},
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "queryCityMatch",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "queryCityAction",
        "ifElse": {
          "condition": {
            "from": "queryCitySkip",
            "path": "$"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "skipQueryCity",
              "call": "json.isEmpty",
              "args": {
                "value": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "fetchCity",
              "call": "web_fetch",
              "args": {
                "url": "https://wttr.in/{{urlencode.input.cityPath}}?format={{input.format}}",
                "storeOnly": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cityCurrent",
              "call": "json.get",
              "args": {
                "path": "current_condition[0]"
              },
              "bindings": [
                {
                  "from": "fetchCity",
                  "path": "$",
                  "as": "value"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "cityDay",
              "call": "json.get",
              "args": {
                "path": "weather[0]"
              },
              "bindings": [
                {
                  "from": "fetchCity",
                  "path": "$",
                  "as": "value"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "cityBrief",
              "call": "json.set",
              "args": {
                "value": {
                  "city": "{{input.city}}"
                },
                "path": "current"
              },
              "bindings": [
                {
                  "from": "cityCurrent",
                  "path": "$",
                  "as": "nextValue"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "cityResult",
              "call": "json.set",
              "args": {
                "path": "day"
              },
              "bindings": [
                {
                  "from": "cityBrief",
                  "path": "$",
                  "as": "value"
                },
                {
                  "from": "cityDay",
                  "path": "$",
                  "as": "nextValue"
                }
              ],
              "yield": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "queryCitiesMatch",
        "call": "json.select",
        "args": {
          "items": [
            "{{input.operation}}"
          ],
          "where": {
            "$": {
              "stringEq": "queryCities"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "queryCitiesSkip",
        "call": "json.isEmpty",
        "args": {},
        "bindings": [
          {
            "from": "queryCitiesMatch",
            "path": "$",
            "as": "value"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "queryCitiesAction",
        "ifElse": {
          "condition": {
            "from": "queryCitiesSkip",
            "path": "$"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "skipQueryCities",
              "call": "json.isEmpty",
              "args": {
                "value": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "normalizeCities",
              "call": "json.concat",
              "args": {
                "arrays": [
                  "{{input.cities}}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fetchEachCity",
              "forEach": {
                "from": "normalizeCities",
                "path": "$",
                "onError": "continue",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "id": "fetchEachWeather",
                    "call": "web_fetch",
                    "args": {
                      "url": "https://wttr.in/{{urlencode.item.path}}?format={{input.format}}",
                      "storeOnly": true
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "eachCurrent",
                    "call": "json.get",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "current_condition[0]"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "fetchEachWeather",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "eachDay",
                    "call": "json.get",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "weather[0]"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "fetchEachWeather",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "eachBrief",
                    "call": "json.set",
                    "args": {
                      "value": {
                        "city": "{{item.name}}"
                      },
                      "path": "current"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "eachCurrent",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "nextValue"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "eachResult",
                    "call": "json.set",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "day"
                    },
                    "bindings": [
                      {
                        "from": "eachBrief",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "value"
                      },
                      {
                        "from": "eachDay",
                        "path": "$",
                        "as": "nextValue"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "yield": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "returnToLLM": true
}
